# test_runs.log

Purpose:
Record public test runs, self-test runs, score progression, and failure categories.

Judges should be able to see how the agent improved over time.

Format:

[YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM] TEST_RUN
Run by: agent/human
Command:
Suite: public/self-generated/manual smoke
Score/result:
Main failing categories:
Agent response/next step:

